page_id = "welcome"
title = "Welcome"
body = "Welcome to the valley.

This place may feel quiet at first, but it is not empty. Care for the land, speak with the townsfolk, and take each day one step at a time.

[b]Tip:[/b] Small actions can lead to new growth."
